    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow okay yeah it sounds like historians pretty much agree on that then. so if the consensus is that unions are basically essential for a fair democracy, is there really any real downside to them? like is there any way they could actually be viewed as a negative force in a democratic society?",
